    title: "ScriptOCR", badge: "Open Source", badgeClass: "oss",
    desc: "A multi-script OCR engine that keeps its coordinates. Auto-detects the script in each region and routes it to a dedicated recogniser — 6 languages (English, Hindi, Telugu, Kannada, Tamil, Malayalam), printed and handwritten — then extracts key/value pairs and tables from page geometry alone (no LLM). Trained the handwriting and Indic recognisers in-house; packaged on ONNX Runtime for CPU-only, fully offline / air-gapped deployment.",
